  "source_parent": "85306187dc4e239c124cc6d3661a65ae39f234c9",
  "scope": "Replace two Pell coordinate positivity contradictions by positive-product reflection",
  "validation": "Both targets and five unique tracked direct Lean clients pass in paired seven-module chains; all five client object pairs match. Seven-object-pinned probes show 25 identical target declaration/type/axiom reports and matching default simp/instance censuses. Current-source Recurrence and HalfIndex provider pairs match prior source-built receipts.",
  "limitations": [
    "HalfIndex producer pinned an older IndexDivisibility built against pre-1a0b5f209e IntegralSolution and pre-c0fb426562 GCD. These are historical producer pins, not independent measurements of transitive objects loaded in the present builds.",
    "Further Pell/construction clients and the wider project, Foundation and Mathlib transitive closure were not rebuilt. Direct source/object producer associations do not establish a fully current-source closure.",
    "The census compares declarations, types, axioms and stated registrations, not proof bodies or every persistent environment extension. Single shared-load CPU timing samples are not a general benchmark. Author records predate commit; the independent review/audit verify parent and final sources.",
    "Compiled objects and cached overlays are omitted. Recorded paths include temporary /dev/shm objects and require those external objects for independent byte verification."
  ],
